1506..1586 Comment "/// The outer region keeps a slot; the inner scope holds `l` and lends a view of"
1587..1667 Comment "/// it; keeping that view in the outer slot is refused at the write — the view"
1668..1710 Comment "/// would outlive the access that lent it."
